 "description": "Audit a webhook delivery log. Reports events that never succeeded and whether they still have retries or have exhausted them and are lost, events delivered more than once so the receiver had to be idempotent, retries issued after a success, and attempts beyond the declared limit. No payload is inspected and no signature or secret is handled. Pay 140000 atomic USDC on Base via exact x402. MCP does not pay; it provides a challenge handoff.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "deliveries": {
    "description": "Delivery records. Status is read from status or status_code, and the event from event_id or id, because both spellings are common.",
    "example": [
     {
      "attempt": 1,
      "event_id": "evt-1",
      "status": 500
     },
     {
      "attempt": 2,
      "event_id": "evt-1",
      "status": 200
     },
     {
      "attempt": 3,
      "event_id": "evt-1",
      "status": 500
     },
     {
